  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074602/description_670c44a4-aa1a-411f-bbfc-4a5fec532b04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"247\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">正在开发中！</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🪑&nbsp;关于 🪑</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具甲虫（Furniture Beetle）是一个专注于为原版游戏添加内容的模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过家具体验全新的“原版+”玩法。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GZiVFXv.png\" alt=\"barra2\" width=\"2063\" height=\"51\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔧 未来更新 🔧</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使烤箱具备功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自定义图形用户界面（GUI）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具颜色变体</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多原版风格家具</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎提供反馈和建议&nbsp;<span>😊</span></span></p>",
